{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ilRnBfvagc1795683450.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>香港道教聯合會，在粉嶺蓬瀛仙館設立宏福苑火災周年祈福追思道場，開放予公眾致祭。</p><p><br/>道場早上舉行追思儀式，聯合會表示希望藉設立追思道場，超度亡靈，禳除火厄，撫慰受火災影響市民的心靈，並祈願香港社會團結和諧。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T10:24:02.319520+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":101,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T06:26:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T10:37:13.981994+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T10:17:18.544854+00:00","content_hash":"7a0da5cc6634833370beab44e9f5585317b27362cc8a614a254e21e5dc075118","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T10:24:02.319520+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}